trong. So I propose D as provisional lead.\n\nBut we must be careful not to ignore crew cooperation concerns. We can argue that D's hot temper may be mitigated.\n\nLet's decide: I will propose Candidate D as provisional lead, bringing new facts, and ask for further info on crew cooperation. Provide vote D.\n\nThus public message: reference that C is currently leading per Agent 1, but I think D's strengths in unexpected events, concentration, problem solving, responsibility make him a stronger overall fit, though we need to examine his temperament. Provide evidence.\n\nProceed."}
